// Package symbolfont recodes the characters of symbol fonts (Wingdings,
// Webdings, Symbol, Monotype Sorts, StarBats and their kin) into OpenSymbol
// code points, as LibreOffice draws a bullet or a symbol of a font the
// printing system lacks (unotools' ConvertChar::RecodeChar, fontcvt.cxx).
//
// The tables in symbols_gen.go are generated by cmd/gen-symbol-fonts from
// LibreOffice core's unotools/source/misc/fontcvt.cxx at a pinned commit.
// [Recode] is what the converters call for a bullet: it returns the glyph
// to draw, the text the glyph stands for in the extracted text, and the
// families to draw it in. The package has no state and is safe for
// concurrent use.
package symbolfont
